<section class="section">
  <div class="container split">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">When this helps</p>
      <h2>Your reports should make decisions easier.</h2>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p>You may already have website analytics, advertising reports, and sales records. The hard part is connecting them well enough to decide what to do.</p>
      <ul class="check-list">
        <li>Different reports disagree, or key actions are not measured consistently.</li>
        <li>Traffic is rising, but enquiries, bookings, or sales are not following.</li>
        <li>You need to decide which channel or customer journey to improve first.</li>
