<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">The work</p>
    <h2>From a business question to an actionable roadmap.</h2>
    <div class="cards">
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Define the outcome</h3>
        <p>Agree on the decision to support and what success means: qualified enquiries, completed bookings, orders, or another business outcome you can track.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Check the measurement</h3>
        <p>Review event definitions, conversion tracking, campaign tagging, and reporting gaps. Separate what is reliable from what needs repair or further evidence.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Find the constraint</h3>
        <p>Compare funnel stages, channels, landing pages, devices, and relevant customer segments. Account for context such as seasonality, changes in spend, and data limitations.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Prioritize the response</h3>
        <p>Rank opportunities by likely impact, confidence, effort, and dependencies. Give each priority an owner, a next action, and a way to evaluate it.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container split">
