    </div>
    <div>
      <ul class="check-list">
        <li>A measurement map with KPI definitions and known data gaps</li>
        <li>A funnel diagnosis with evidence, assumptions, and unanswered questions</li>
        <li>A prioritized roadmap with suggested sequencing and responsibilities</li>
        <li>A reporting structure for reviewing progress and deciding what changes next</li>
      </ul>
      <p>The final scope depends on your question and the data available. Private analytics, advertising, and sales data are reviewed only with agreed access.</p>
